@PrintDebateText Text:結局、<br>二階堂の前に<br>エレベーターに乗ったのは<br>誰なんだよ。|#0204Trial01_Alisa001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Default,ArmR4,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Surprised_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:お、おじさんになるのかな？|#0204Trial01_Miria001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Default,ArmR4,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Surprised_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:でもそのときは<br>死体なんてなかったよ！|#0204Trial01_Miria002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,55 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Default,ArmR3,ArmL1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Surprised_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:上の階では<br>わたくしとシェリーさんが<br>ミリアさんが出てくるのを<br>見ていましたわ……。|#0204Trial01_Hanna001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR17,ArmL12,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"でもエレベーターの中には<br>エマさんの死体なんて<br><link=\"Objection_02_04_01_01\">ありません</link>でしたけどねー。|#0204Trial01_Sherry001|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR17,ArmL12,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"エレベーターの中に<br><link=\"Objection_02_04_01_02\">隠れられるところ</link>も<br>ありませんでしたし……。|#0204Trial01_Sherry002|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Default,ArmR4,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Surprised_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"つ、つまりおじさんは<br><link=\"Objection_02_04_01_03\">何もしてない</link><br>ってことだよ！|#0204Trial01_Miria003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:じゃあやっぱり、<br>犯人は二階堂でしかねーだろ。|#0204Trial01_Alisa002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:エレベーターが<br>下に降りてから、<br>二階堂が桜羽を殺した。|#0204Trial01_Alisa003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"……もしくは<br><link=\"Objection_02_04_01_04\">あらかじめ殺していた</link><br>死体を持ってきて、<br>見つけたフリをしたんだろ。|#0204Trial01_Alisa004|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:それしか<br>考えられねーじゃねーか。|#0204Trial01_Alisa005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4


